    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_draft">Draft - updated as features are added</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Zunivo itself collects no personal data and has no accounts. When you search, your search words are sent to the public Iconify API (api.iconify.design), and icon images are loaded from it; Iconify may log requests under its own policy. Any future feature that uses your images or accounts will explain what data it uses and ask for your consent first.</string>

    <string name="help_title">Help</string>
    <string name="help_body">Type a keyword in Search or pick a category to find icons. Tap an icon to see its set, author and license. Change the language from Settings. Features marked as a later phase will be enabled as the app grows.</string>

